一条带有小饰品的精致颈链，与她别致而前卫的造型相得益彰。她那黑色的直发和刘海勾勒出她的脸型，增添了整体的哥特式美感。"], "flags": {}, "id": 409, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "text", "slot_index": 0, "links": [630], "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "bgcolor": "#353", "size": {"0": 354.75726318359375, "1": 159.0809783935547}, "color": "#232", "pos": [220, 1130], "widgets_values": ["这是她18岁时的全身照。悠闲放松的姿态，自然，平面模特，这张时尚年轻女子的照片在搭配的服装中散发出迷人的复古气息。低角度拍摄，她穿着格子套装，由领口和下摆饰有褶边的长袖短款衬衫搭配同样饰有褶边的高腰不对称裙子组成。她的配饰包括深棕色带扣鞋、白色袜子和棕色单肩包。她手里拿着一个小泰迪熊饰物，头发散落，手指间俏皮地夹着一个饰物。她的造型融合了俏皮精致和复古别致的元素，打造出独特而时尚的外观。"], "flags": {}, "id": 410, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 24}], "extra": {"0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": {"0": 280.73744523688106, "1": -131.19312526635449}, "scale": 0.7972024500000049}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "title": "5.PuLID Flux", "locked": true, "bounding": [-188, -208, 747, 428]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "title": "7.Sampler", "locked": true, "bounding": [1290, -204, 3902, 2753]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "title": "3.GGUFmodel", "locked": true, "bounding": [-598, -209, 406, 206]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "title": "4.Lora", "locked": true, "bounding": [-595, 4, 404, 215]}, {"color": "#8A8", "font_size": 24, "title": "2.Prompt ", "locked": true, "bounding": [179, 229, 1100, 1183]}, {"color": "#ffffff", "font_size": 24, "title": "1 load image", "locked": true, "bounding": [-594, 227, 767, 1182]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "title": "6.public", "locked": true, "bounding": [569, -210, 713, 431]}], "links": [[84, 25, 0, 48, 0, "NOISE"], [85, 16, 0, 48, 2, "SAMPLER"], [86, 27, 0, 48, 4, "LATENT"], [87, 48, 0, 49, 0, "LATENT"], [88, 10, 0, 49, 1, "VAE"], [89, 49, 0, 50, 0, "IMAGE"], [93, 17, 0, 48, 3, "SIGMAS"], [122, 62, 0, 47, 0, "MODEL"], [123, 51, 0, 62, 2, "EVA_CLIP"], [124, 53, 0, 62, 3, "FACEANALYSIS"], [125, 45, 0, 6